# Welcome chime
@scenario office_lesson_06
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk present]
pip: Two notes tell the player the game is ready. Listen once.
[sfx assets/tutorial/welcome.wav]
pip: Find the WAV in assets/tutorial. Trigger it again from the replay choice after the checkpoint.
@label check
pip: Which command fits a short welcome chime?
> bgm -> retry
> sfx -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: A one-shot sound can finish while the scene continues. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: A one-shot sound can finish while the scene continues.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_06]
[flag tutorial_done_06]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_2]
